@startuml legacy_flow
!theme plain
skinparam BackgroundColor #ffffff
skinparam componentStyle uml2

title Eye Compass - Legacy Application Architecture Flow

actor Operator

package "Legacy Eye Compass (Monolithic PyQt5 App - main.py)" {

    node "User Interface (eye_compass_ui.py)" {
        [Login Screen]
        [New Batch / Data Collection Form]
        [Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)]
        [Results & History]
    }

    node "Authentication & Sync" {
        [Auth Manager]
        [Qualix Sync Service]
    }

    node "Hardware Control (Serial / GPIO)" {
        [SerialReaderThread]
        [SerialWriterThread]
    }

    node "Vision & Machine Learning" {
        [Camera Frame Grabber\n(OpenCV / GStreamer)]
        [YOLOv7 Inference Engine\n(TensorRT / ONNX)]
        [Object Tracker\n(DeepSORT)]
    }

    node "Data Storage & Upload" {
        [Local SQLite DB\n(EyeCompass.db)]
        [Local Excel / CSV Exporter]
        [Video Compressor\n(compress_video.py)]
        [Cloud Uploader\n(upload_videos_pool_id.py)]
    }
}

cloud "External Services" {
    [Qualix API (agnext.in)]
    [AWS S3 / Cloud Storage]
}

node "Physical Hardware" {
    [Industrial Camera (Basler)]
    [Conveyor & Reject Mechanisms\n(PLC / Microcontroller)]
}

' Flow Connections

Operator --> [Login Screen] : Inputs Credentials
[Login Screen] --> [Auth Manager] : Validates
[Auth Manager] --> [Qualix API (agnext.in)] : POST /portal/login (Cookie Auth)
[Auth Manager] --> [Qualix Sync Service] : Trigger fetch configuration
[Qualix Sync Service] --> [Qualix API (agnext.in)] : GET /api/v1/quality/dropdowns...
[Qualix Sync Service] --> [New Batch / Data Collection Form] : Populates Commodity, Variety, FM types

Operator --> [New Batch / Data Collection Form] : Selects Batch details
[New Batch / Data Collection Form] --> [Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] : Navigates to dashboard

Operator --> [Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] : Clicks Start
[Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] --> [SerialWriterThread] : Sends "machine_start" command
[SerialWriterThread] --> [Conveyor & Reject Mechanisms\n(PLC / Microcontroller)] : Serial TX

[Industrial Camera (Basler)] --> [Camera Frame Grabber\n(OpenCV / GStreamer)] : Sends video frames
[Camera Frame Grabber\n(OpenCV / GStreamer)] --> [YOLOv7 Inference Engine\n(TensorRT / ONNX)] : Dispatches frames for inference
[YOLOv7 Inference Engine\n(TensorRT / ONNX)] --> [Object Tracker\n(DeepSORT)] : Bounding boxes & classifications
[Object Tracker\n(DeepSORT)] --> [Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] : Updates UI with counts/FPS

[Conveyor & Reject Mechanisms\n(PLC / Microcontroller)] --> [SerialReaderThread] : Serial RX (Sensors, errors)
[SerialReaderThread] --> [Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] : Updates UI status

' Data Persistence Flow
[Object Tracker\n(DeepSORT)] --> [Local SQLite DB\n(EyeCompass.db)] : Saves foreign matter counts
[Object Tracker\n(DeepSORT)] --> [Local Excel / CSV Exporter] : Updates local spreadsheet logs

' End of Batch Flow
Operator --> [Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] : Clicks Stop
[Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] --> [SerialWriterThread] : Sends "all_stop" command
[Main Dashboard (Camera Feed, Start/Stop)] --> [Video Compressor\n(compress_video.py)] : Triggers video saving
[Video Compressor\n(compress_video.py)] --> [Cloud Uploader\n(upload_videos_pool_id.py)] : Queues for upload
[Cloud Uploader\n(upload_videos_pool_id.py)] --> [AWS S3 / Cloud Storage] : Uploads video and images
[Cloud Uploader\n(upload_videos_pool_id.py)] --> [Qualix API (agnext.in)] : Uploads metadata/bounding boxes

@enduml
